msgid "help.studio_h4"
msgstr "How to protect text for AI prompts or data sharing"

msgid "help.studio_kbd_btn"
msgstr "View shortcuts ➔"

msgid "help.studio_kbd_prompt"
msgstr "Prefer working with the keyboard? Check out the full quick shortcuts reference."

msgid "help.studio_p1"
msgstr "The main goal of the Transform view is to let you safely interact with language models (such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, or local AIs) or share documents without exposing confidential information (client names, IDs, IBANs, passwords, IP addresses, or payment cards)."

msgid "help.studio_pandoc_desc"
msgstr "If you enable saving to Markdown with Pandoc, LexiShield converts structured documents (.docx, .html, .rst) into native Markdown (.md), preserving headings, lists, and tables for optimal AI token efficiency."

msgid "help.studio_pandoc_title"
msgstr "Markdown conversion with Pandoc:"

msgid "help.studio_wf1"
msgstr "Paste content into the Clear text panel (or drag and drop a file or folder directly onto it)."

msgid "help.studio_wf2"
msgstr "Auto detection: the engine automatically identifies the syntactic structure (JSON, XML, logs, or plain text) with zero configuration."

msgid "help.studio_wf3"
msgstr "Click Protect: the central directional button replaces every confidential item with a consistent protected value."

msgid "help.studio_wf4"
msgstr "Reactive Markdown mode: clicking the Markdown switch in the top bar automatically protects the original text and shows a formatted preview in both panels."

msgid "help.studio_wf5"
msgstr "Use the text with AI: copy the Protected text and send it with complete peace of mind to any AI model or third party."

msgid "help.studio_wf6"
msgstr "Restore the AI response: when the AI replies citing protected values, paste its reply into Protected text and click Restore to recover 100% of the real values."

