msgid "help.vaults_backup_desc"
msgstr "The Full backup button packages all your settings and vaults into a single Bzip2-compressed archive (optionally encrypted with AES-256). With Restore backup you can recover any backup archive (.tar.bz2 or .lexibak) completely."

