msgid "help.vaults_h4"
msgstr "Lexi vaults management and backups"

msgid "help.vaults_p1"
msgstr "Vaults (.lexi) are hermetic binary files where your tokens and mappings reside. You can create multiple vaults to separate clients, projects, or personal environments."

msgid "help.watch_feat1"
msgstr "Top bar control: click Monitor to start listening and Stop to pause it."

msgid "help.watch_feat2"
msgstr "Transparent notification: when copying text with no secrets, it reports 0 tokens recognized so you know the text was left untouched."

msgid "help.watch_feat3"
msgstr "Immediate preview: history shows in real time both the captured text and the transformed result placed in the clipboard."

msgid "help.watch_feat4"
msgstr "Secure wipe: click Clear clipboard in the top bar or schedule automatic wiping after N seconds in Settings."

